BT 1 0 0 1 0 0 Tm 1 0 0 1 54 730.8 Tm 13 TL (# Plant Science Brief: Drought Tolerance in Wheat) Tj T*  T* (Drought is the single largest abiotic constraint on wheat \(Triticum) Tj T* (aestivum\) productivity worldwide, with global yield losses estimated at) Tj T* (10-50% in affected seasons depending on developmental stage and severity.) Tj T* (This brief summarises canonical molecular and physiological mechanisms) Tj T* (cereal crops deploy to tolerate water deficit, with a focus on wheat.) Tj T*  T* (## Hormonal Signalling) Tj T*  T* (Abscisic acid \(ABA\) is the master regulator of drought response. Stress) Tj T* (triggers ABA biosynthesis primarily through NCED gene family) Tj T* (upregulation. ABA binds PYR/PYL/RCAR receptors, inhibits PP2C) Tj T* (phosphatases, and allows SnRK2 kinases to phosphorylate downstream) Tj T* (effectors including SLAC1, AREB/ABF transcription factors, and ion) Tj T* (channels.) Tj T*  T* (## Stomatal Regulation) Tj T*  T* (ABA-driven stomatal closure reduces transpirational water loss but also) Tj T* (constrains CO2 uptake. Cultivars with rapid stomatal closure show) Tj T* (improved early-stage survival; cultivars that maintain partial stomatal) Tj T* (conductance perform better under mild, sustained deficit.) Tj T*  T* (## Osmotic Adjustment) Tj T*  T* (Accumulation of compatible solutes -- proline, glycine betaine,) Tj T* (trehalose, and soluble sugars -- maintains cell turgor under low water) Tj T* (potential. P5CS and BADH gene family overexpression has been) Tj T* (demonstrated to improve drought tolerance in transgenic wheat and) Tj T* (barley.) Tj T*  T* (## Key Loci) Tj T*  T* (- TaSnRK2.10 -- kinase central to ABA signalling; linked QTLs on) Tj T* (  chromosome 6A associate with field drought tolerance.) Tj T* (- TaDREB1A -- DREB/CBF-family transcription factor binding DRE/CRT) Tj T* (  cis-elements upstream of stress-response genes.) Tj T* (- TaNAC69 -- NAC family; ABA-responsive, regulates root architecture) Tj T* (  under deficit.) Tj T*  T* (This brief is a synthesised demo summary and not a peer-reviewed source.) Tj T* ET
 
